{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：03:49 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：03:49 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：03:49 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3fac96ebf9653e4a4884a1396c25b4de/2026-11/2026-11-26_19_26_35.png\"/><p>柴灣發生墮樓事故。周四（26日）晚上7時06分，有市民報案，指發現一名男子倒臥柴灣道對開，懷疑從高處墮下。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，將昏迷的87歲姓曾男子送往東區醫院搶救，其後證實不治。</p><p>警方經初步調查，相信事主從上址一處平台墮下，現場沒有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍確定。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T20:04:21.467725+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T19:49:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T19:57:49.042345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T19:57:49.042345+00:00","content_hash":"4df7ed8175be43162fc94d1d01aa903aa19aea31c5b985dfd741262f45a8d0b1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}